# Git ship (branch, commit, push, PR)

**Order:** **`git-pr-branch-hygiene`** (rebase) → commit with Jira key (**`git-commit-jira-prefix`**) → **`pre-push-quality-gates`** → `git push` → **`create-pr`** PR-body refresh if the branch has an open PR and scope changed.

| Step | Skill / rule |
|------|----------------|
| Branch / rebase | **`git-pr-branch-hygiene`** |
| Commit message | **`git-commit-jira-prefix`** + **`git-commit`** |
| Lint / format before push | **`pre-push-quality-gates`** |
| Open or refresh PR body | **`create-pr`** (draft by default; body rules live there only) |
| Remote PR URL review | **`remote-pr-review`** |

Do not push until quality gates pass (or the user accepts skipping after a reported blocker).
